Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.62,0:03:03.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}麦哲伦先生  你只答对了四十六州{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Uh, Magellan? You got 46 states.{\r}
